## Design rationale

The check mirrors KS Python guard patterns (`if not sidebar_html.strip(): return …`, `if breadcrumb_html.strip():`, etc.) by inspecting the rendered DOM for optional regions that should have been omitted or collapsed. It stays deterministic—bounding-box height, heading vs body character counts, and presence of substantive body nodes—without AI heuristics.
